# input-deny: a SEND on the `input` class without the class's verb bits.
#
# Its only verb bit, 58, is one the input drivers do not check, so every
# gated label sent through a driver SEND it yields replies the driver's
# UNAUTHORIZED; svctest's drivers deny phase asserts that. svcmgr publishes
# it seed-only as `devmgr.class.input-deny`, which only svctest seeds.
# Test-only: this directory is not scanned; the svctest recipe copies the
# file into /config/devmgr/classes/ (docs/testing.md).
class = input
verbs = 58
